# Geological Appraiser: "When this creature enters, if you cast it, discover 3."
# Turn 1 Bot1 casts the Appraiser with Black Lotus (RRR) and a Mox Jet. Discover 3 (CR 701.57a) exiles a Hill Giant (mana value 4, skipped)
# and finds a Hypnotic Specter (mana value exactly 3), which Bot1 casts free: it enters, and the Hill Giant goes to the bottom of the
# library with the Lightning Bolt (mana value 1, never reached) still on top.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Geological Appraiser
Plains x4
Hill Giant
Hypnotic Specter
Lightning Bolt
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

